  "title": "Week 43: Use Remotion for Marketing",
  "date": "2026-10-29T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 43: Use Remotion for Marketing\n\nBecause all the interns have finished their terms. Now I do not have any people to handle the marketing updates.\n\nIt is going to be Halloween. I need to make a short commercial to show the Halloween updates. Then I realized that this is a great time to try Remotion to build the video.\n\nour game includes a Shaman which can call the animals, rains and unlock new maps. He can be used for our Halloween commercial. I collected all the features Shaman can do, all the images as source. Then use Claude Opus 5.5 to write the plan. Then use Haiku 5.5 to implement the project. Only cost me 36% of the 4h usage (Pro account).\nAll the scenes are editable with Typescript. So any error can be easily fixed.\n\nLater I will consider use Symphony to make this process automatically. If you like the game, you can click the steam link to check it out.",
